# Cloudflare Pages redirects.
#
# Stripe, Google and app-store checklists all ask for a "privacy policy URL" and a
# "terms of service URL". People (and those checklists) guess /privacy-policy and
# /terms-of-service; our real pages are /privacy and /terms. Rather than let those
# guesses 404 — which reads as "this business has no policy" — send them to the
# page that exists. 301 so the correction sticks in caches and search engines.
/privacy-policy /privacy 301
/privacy-policy/* /privacy 301
/privacy_policy /privacy 301
/terms-of-service /terms 301
/terms-of-service/* /terms 301
/tos /terms 301
